Falsifies `block_driver_roles::verification::the_lookup_matches_a_whole_name_only`.

The defect: the end-of-name check is dropped, so a name matches any entry whose field merely
starts with it. "motd" then finds an entry named "motdx", and the driver loads the wrong file.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(find_file(&directory, name), whole.then_some(start))`,
on an entry whose field opens with the name and has a nonzero byte after it.

